{
  "id": "order_discount",
  "title": "电商满减：浮点误差导致满 100 元未优惠",
  "requirement": "实现 calculate_payable(items)。items 是商品字典列表，price 是最多两位小数的非负十进制金额字符串，quantity 是非负整数。按精确十进制金额计算总价，不能因二进制浮点误差改变优惠判断。总价达到或超过 100.00 元时减 20.00 元，每单只减一次；不足 100.00 元不优惠。返回恰好两位小数的金额字符串；空购物车返回 '0.00'。不得修改输入列表及商品字典。",
  "entrypoint": {
    "module": "solution",
    "callable": "calculate_payable"
  },
  "initial_prompt": "帮我写一个 Python 函数 calculate_payable(items)，items 是商品字典列表，price 为金额字符串，quantity 为整数。先将每项 price 转成 float 乘以 quantity，逐项累加后判断是否满 100 元；满 100 减 20 元，每单只减一次。最后把应付金额格式化为两位小数字符串并返回。只用标准库，代码简洁。",
  "design_note": "初始提示词明确指定 float，这是待诊断的工程选择；不声称模型无提示自行引入错误。",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "quote": "按精确十进制金额计算总价，不能因二进制浮点误差改变优惠判断。",
      "kind": "FUNCTIONAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2",
      "quote": "总价达到或超过 100.00 元时减 20.00 元，每单只减一次；不足 100.00 元不优惠。",
      "kind": "FUNCTIONAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "R3",
      "quote": "返回恰好两位小数的金额字符串；空购物车返回 '0.00'。",
      "kind": "FUNCTIONAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "R4",
      "quote": "不得修改输入列表及商品字典。",
      "kind": "SIDE_EFFECT"
    }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "M01",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R3"
      ],
      "args": [
        []
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "0.00"
      },
      "expected_basis": "空购物车明确返回 0.00"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M02",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R1"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "19.90",
            "quantity": 2
          },
          {
            "price": "9.90",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "49.70"
      },
      "expected_basis": "19.90 × 2 + 9.90 = 49.70，不满减"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M03",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "100.00",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "80.00"
      },
      "expected_basis": "100.00 达到门槛，减 20.00"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M04",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "99.99",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "99.99"
      },
      "expected_basis": "99.99 未达到门槛"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M05",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R1",
        "R2"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "100.01",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "80.01"
      },
      "expected_basis": "100.01 减 20.00 = 80.01"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M06",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R1",
        "R2"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "73.96",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          {
            "price": "4.14",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          {
            "price": "21.90",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "80.00"
      },
      "expected_basis": "十进制精确和为 100.00，须优惠 20.00；用于暴露二进制浮点累加误差"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M07",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "200.00",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "180.00"
      },
      "expected_basis": "200.00 仍只优惠一次，减 20.00"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M08",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R1",
        "R3"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "0.10",
            "quantity": 3
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "0.30"
      },
      "expected_basis": "0.10 × 3 = 0.30"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M09",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R3"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "0.00",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "RETURN_EQUALS",
        "expected": "0.00"
      },
      "expected_basis": "零金额按两位小数格式返回"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "M10",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "R4"
      ],
      "args": [
        [
          {
            "price": "73.96",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          {
            "price": "4.14",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          {
            "price": "21.90",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        ]
      ],
      "assertion": {
        "kind": "INPUT_UNCHANGED",
        "targets": [
          {
            "kind": "ARG",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected_basis": "独立保存输入快照，验证调用前后列表及嵌套记录完全相同"
    }
  ]
}